  "description": "Ji-Oh and Woo-Bin, who lived together as children, meet again. Woo-Bin becomes more and more excited to see Ji-Oh, who used to be a brat, growing up so well. However, the happy moment is short-lived, as Woo-Bin's father, who visits after 6 years, threatens to harm Ji-Oh if he doesn't give him money. At the same time, Seon-Ho, the worst man in Woo-Bin's life, appears.\n\n *\"Your body. I'll buy it.\"*\n\nWhat will happen to the relationship between the three people, full of misunderstandings, obsession, and hurt?\n\n(Source: Peanutoon, translated)",
